m/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T18:45:26Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T18:45:26Z","body":"Godot doesn't support a dedicated unsigned int type. How can we make this fit Godot Engine?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2552034505/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2552446118","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100528#issuecomment-2552446118","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100528","id":2552446118,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YIzym","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T23:16:12Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T23:16:12Z","body":"> Needed this for some platform specific api stuff and it seemed like a good general improvement. No point exposing to scripting as there is no uint64 type in GDScript.\r\n\r\nIs this in-tree platform specific API stuff?\r\n\r\nAlso, I recently refactored the to_int methods. The pattern has slightly changed, although it doesn't matter that much for this case it might be nice for it to mirror the other code, assuming this method has a (planned) function in tree. If this is only for out of tree targets I don't think we want to take this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2552446118/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602796441","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100528#issuecomment-2602796441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100528","id":2602796441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bI4WZ","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T16:06:37Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T16:06:37Z","body":"To address some comments, here the gdscript and variants don't support uint but many plugins and other c++ work does. I found myself needing to make this change as some c++ plug-in work for my project needed a robust uint string conversion to work with console platform API which often use unit identifiers as both number or string depending on context and platform. \n\nThis is a common need for various API so it's useful. Key requirements are speed and predictability so I kept it simple in behaviour.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602796441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]